==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Mew}}.
*'''Psyshot''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Sabrina's Kadabra|58}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*'''Genome Hacking''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|151|Mew ex|151}} from the {{TCG|151}} expansion.

